WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.630
This deck includes a portable SQL practice engine in
the browser It

00:00:05.656 --> 00:00:10.501
is not a Spark cluster We use it to practice the
relational logic that will

00:00:10.527 --> 00:00:17.774
transfer to Spark SQL such as grouping joins windows
and grain checks Spark-specific

00:00:17.801 --> 00:00:22.314
file reading and Delta operations should be run in
Fabric or another Spark environment
